  - name: general_partner_name
    type: string
    description: Legal name of the general partner
    section: Fund
  - name: manager_name
    type: string
    description: Legal name of the investment manager
    section: Fund
  - name: limited_partner_name
    type: string
    description: Legal name of the subscribing investor completing the questionnaire
    section: Investor
  - name: qualified_client_aum_threshold
    type: string
    description: >-
      Assets-under-management amount in the Commission's most recent Rule 205-3
      order, as a formatted dollar amount
    default: '$1,400,000'
    section: Eligibility
    default_value_rationale: >-
      The amount set by SEC Order IA-6961 (2026) for Rule 205-3(d)(1)(i). It is
      indexed about every five years, so confirm the most recent order before
      use.
    rationale_source: editorial
  - name: qualified_client_net_worth_threshold
    type: string
    description: >-
      Net-worth amount in the Commission's most recent Rule 205-3 order, as a
      formatted dollar amount
    default: '$2,700,000'
    section: Eligibility
    default_value_rationale: >-
      The amount set by SEC Order IA-6961 (2026) for Rule 205-3(d)(1)(ii)(A). It
      is indexed about every five years, so confirm the most recent order before
      use.
    rationale_source: editorial
  - name: qualified_purchaser_screen
    type: boolean
    description: >-
      Require every investor to complete the qualified-purchaser section, for a
      fund that relies on Section 3(c)(7)
    help: >-
      Leave unselected for a fund that relies on Section 3(c)(1), as the Hedge
      Fund Limited Partnership Agreement and Private Placement Memorandum do;
      the qualified-purchaser section then serves only as a route to
      qualified-client status. Select it only after conforming those documents
      to a Section 3(c)(7) fund.
    default: false
    section: Eligibility
priority_fields:
